# mod-custom-spells: the Mage lines of the third concept list
# (operator 2026-10-31; share-public
# custom-spells/records/2026-10-31-third-concept-list.md), wave 2 = procs and
# stacking buffs (900720 Blink: Mirror Image, 900721 Mirror Images: Strength in
# Numbers with its aura 900722, 900744 Dragon's Breath: Living Bomb, 900745
# Molten Armor: Flamestrike, 900775 Ice Block: Ice Lance Barrage, 900776 Ice
# Block: Detonation with the helpers 900777 / 900778). Every check states the
# list's line, so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150); d1 = the west-most one. Slot 4
# belongs to the cs_* scenarios; the cleanup unlearns every custom spell again.
# Spells: Blink 1953 (a 20-yd leap forward), Mirror Image 55342 (3 images, NPC
# 31216, about 30 s), Dragon's Breath 42950 (rank 6, a cone in front), Living
# Bomb 55360 (rank 3, talent), Molten Armor 43046 (rank 3), Arcane Explosion
# 42921 (22 % of 3268 base mana = 718, 8 yd round the mage: the ring's every
# dummy), Flamestrike 42926 (rank 9), Ice Block 45438, Ice Lance 42914 (rank 3).
name    Custom spells - Mage third list
timeout 300s

bot ma mage slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require ma alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near ma
require d1 exists
do gm target ma
as gm .unlearn 900700
as gm .unlearn 900709
as gm .unlearn 900713
as gm .unlearn 900714
as gm .unlearn 900715
as gm .unlearn 900716
as gm .unlearn 900720
as gm .unlearn 900721
as gm .unlearn 900744
as gm .unlearn 900745
as gm .unlearn 900775
as gm .unlearn 900776
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 43046
as gm .unaura 45438
do ma learn 1953
do ma learn 55342
do ma learn 42950
do ma learn 55360
do ma learn 43046
do ma learn 42921
do ma learn 42926
do ma learn 45438
do ma learn 42914
as gm .aura 59756
waitfor ma aura 59756 timeout 2s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Arcane
log Arcane - control for 900720: a Blink without the passive spawns no Mirror Image
do ma reset
do ma cast 1953 triggered
wait 1500ms
expect ma minions 31216 == 0

log Arcane - 900720 "blinking spawns a mirror image for 20seconds on the target location": one Mirror Image (31216) of the mage appears with the Blink and is gone 20 s later
do ma learn 900720
do ma goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do ma reset
do ma cast 1953 triggered
waitfor ma minions 31216 >= 1 timeout 3s
wait 500ms
expect ma minions 31216 == 1
wait 17s
expect ma minions 31216 == 1
wait 4s
expect ma minions 31216 == 0
as gm .unlearn 900720

log Arcane - control for 900721: Mirror Image (3 images) without the passive - the images carry no Strength in Numbers (900722)
do ma goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do ma reset
do ma cast 55342 triggered
waitfor ma minions 31216 >= 3 timeout 3s
wait 1s
pick img creature:31216 near ma
require img exists
expect img noaura 900722

log Arcane - 900721 "mirror images damage is increased by 5% for each mirror image alive": with the passive each of the 3 images carries Strength in Numbers (900722, +5 % damage done per stack) with 3 stacks
do ma learn 900721
wait 1s
expect img aurastacks 900722 == 3

log Arcane - 900721 without the passive the aura goes again
as gm .unlearn 900721
wait 1s
expect img noaura 900722

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fire
log Fire - control for 900744: Dragon's Breath (a cone in front of the mage, standing next to d1 facing it) hits d1 and puts no Living Bomb on anybody without the passive
do ma approach d1 3
wait 500ms
do ma reset
spelllog start
do ma cast 42950 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect ma spell 42950 casts >= 1
expect ma spell 55360 casts == 0

log Fire - 900744 "enemies hit by dragon breath also receive living bomb": with the passive every enemy the breath hits also gets the mage's highest Living Bomb (55360)
do ma learn 900744
do ma reset
spelllog start
do ma cast 42950 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect ma spell 42950 casts >= 1
expect ma spell 55360 casts >= 1
expect d1 aura 55360
as gm .unlearn 900744

log Fire - 900745 "molten armor has a 5% chance on damage to cast a free flamestrike on the target": Molten Armor up, 20 Arcane Explosions on the ring (8 dummies each, 1 s cooldown on the proc: about 30 % per explosion; P(none) below 0.1 %) - the free Flamestrike (42926) is cast by the proc, the mage never casts it itself
do ma goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do ma learn 900745
do ma cast 43046 triggered
waitfor ma aura 43046 timeout 2s
do ma reset
spelllog start
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma reset
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma reset
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma reset
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
do ma cast 42921
wait 1700ms
spelllog stop
expect ma spell 42921 casts >= 18
expect ma spell 42926 casts >= 1
as gm .unlearn 900745
as gm .unaura 43046

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Frost
log Frost - control for 900775 / 900776: Ice Block (45438) without the passives fires no Ice Lance and detonates nothing (ring's middle, 3 s, then the block is taken off)
do ma goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do ma reset
spelllog start
do ma cast 45438 triggered
waitfor ma aura 45438 timeout 2s
wait 3s
as gm .unaura 45438
waitfor ma noaura 45438 timeout 2s
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect ma spell 42914 casts == 0
expect ma spell 900778 casts == 0

log Frost - 900775 "while in iceblock you auto fire an ice lance to every enemy in 25y range every 0.5 sec": the ticker 900777 lives with the block, about 6 ticks in 3.2 s each throw an Ice Lance (42914) at the 8 dummies (hit rolls decide how many land: 24 casts at least)
do ma learn 900775
do ma reset
spelllog start
do ma cast 45438 triggered
waitfor ma aura 45438 timeout 2s
wait 500ms
expect ma aura 900777
wait 2700ms
spelllog stop
expect ma spell 42914 casts >= 24
expect ma spell 42914 targets >= 7

log Frost - 900776 "when iceblock end it detonates and deal aoe damage dependend on paragon level": taking the block off ends the ticker and detonates 900778 (Frost, 666 + 5 x the Paragon level) on the 8 dummies once
do ma learn 900776
spelllog start
as gm .unaura 45438
waitfor ma noaura 45438 timeout 2s
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect ma noaura 900777
expect ma spell 900778 casts == 1
expect ma spell 900778 targets >= 7
as gm .unlearn 900775
as gm .unlearn 900776

cleanup
do ma stop
do gm target ma
as gm .unaura 43046
as gm .unaura 45438
as gm .unaura 59756
as gm .unaura 900722
as gm .unlearn 900720
as gm .unlearn 900721
as gm .unlearn 900744
as gm .unlearn 900745
as gm .unlearn 900775
as gm .unlearn 900776
